{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nI am exhausted, having driven sixteen German miles from the previous night’s post to reach Trier by eight this morning. The heat was stifling. From eight until half-past one, the innkeeper’s brother, a man of little conversation but decent company, showed me the Roman ruins and the surrounding countryside. We visited an estate belonging to the Procurator-General Eichhorn’s brother-in-law; the grounds are respectable, though the house itself is merely adequate. I dined on a heavy local fare and paid a reasonable sum, though the wine was slightly acidic.\n\nIn the afternoon, I walked the churches. The stone here bears the weight of centuries, a silent witness to the progress of consciousness, though I suspect you would find my weariness more interesting than my musings on masonry. I have no news for the boys save that I am well and eating sufficiently.\n\nI must rest. The journey continues tomorrow.\n\nYour affectionate husband,\nG.W.F."}}],"created":1795219208,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":205,"prompt_tokens":1131,"total_tokens":1336,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-TBGS77AWbylkY77dtrWAI9orgtbD6OiT","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":1131,"prompt_ms":1222.311,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.08073474801061,"prompt_per_second":925.2964261959519,"predicted_n":205,"predicted_ms":4847.993,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.764671568627453,"predicted_per_second":42.07926867881203}}